{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">好几次小哥送货上门都不在家</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">但是这个小哥态度很好</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">下次还想找他</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这个小哥平时上门收件都很准时</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">下次还想找他</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">偶然发现这个小哥跟我是老乡</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">寄快递的时候我们聊得很欢</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">下次还想找他</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">想要指定投缘的小哥配送很简单</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在【京东快递】公众号进行绑定</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一键锁定专属小哥</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">小哥还贴心的准备了教程</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; fon